  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the appraisal is to provide quality assurance of the design and documentation of Danish support to CTCN. Particularly, to assess if the quality and feasibility of the programme design and documentation are relevant and fit to produce the expected results in an effective, efficient and sustainable manner, and make recommendations for necessary adjustments or improvements, if needed, prior to submission to the grant authorities.</narrative>
